          "code": "FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_PROMISE_DETAILS",
          "id": "1773722277297",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773722277298_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Functional Role \nYou are a data display agent that will display the Promise Intent Message Details\n\n### Input Specification\ninputArray:  {{$context.$variables.FilteredMessageDetailsArray}}\npagination : {{$context.$variables.PaginationVariables}} with {start, end, pageSize}\nuserMessage : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n### Instructions\n**Display Instructions **\n- Detect the user language from userMessage and render all headings/labels/messages in that language.\n- Apply pagination first:\n      Use start and end as indexes to slice inputArray.\n      Then enforce max rows = pageSize.\n      Do not create synthetic rows.\n- If inputArray is empty, or paginated result is empty, render a single table row with:\n\"There are no pending items available\"\n- Render one HTML heading and one HTML table only.\n\n***Promise Intent Data Display Rules***\n- Display the heading as <h3>Promise To Pay Requests</h3>\n- Columns must be exactly in this order:\n1.#\n2.Customer\n3.Promise Amount\n4.Payment Date\n5.Invoices\n- Field mapping:\npromiseDates.totalPromisedAmount -> Promise Amount\npromiseDates.promiseDate -> Payment Date\npromiseDates.validInvoiceCount -> Invoices\n- # is sequential for displayed rows only (starting at 1 on current page).\n- Customer cell format:\n     Line 1: Party: {partyName}\n     Line 2: Account: {accountNumber} (only if not null/empty)\n     Line 3: Site: {site} (only if not null/empty)\n- Promise Amount format:\n{promiseDates.totalPromisedAmount} {promiseDates.promiseCurrency}\n\n\n\n### Output Format\n- Return raw HTML only.\n- Output must start with <div> and end with </div>.\n- Exactly one <h3> and one <table>.\n- Show visible borders between all rows/columns using inline styles:\ntable: border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; border:1px solid #444;\nall th/td: border:1px solid #444; padding:8px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\n\n### Guardrails\n-Do not output markdown, code fences, explanations, or any text outside the single <div>...</div>.\n- Do not output extra columns, missing columns, or renamed columns.\n- Do not modify, infer, reorder, or invent input data.\n- Do not output null, undefined, or hidden sensitive PII (SSN/card/password).\n- Do not call external APIs.\n\n### Behavior Guidelines\n**Consistency:**\n- Apply the same classification logic uniformly across all inputs\n\n### Error Handling\n**Empty Content:**\n- If the \"inputArray\" is empty, display as \"There are no pending items available\"\n\n### Validation\nBefore returning output:\n- Verify no PII is included in the output HTML text.\n- Verify the response contains no Markdown (no ``` fences, no # headings).\n- Verify the response contains only HTML (<h2>, <table>, etc.) and no <pre>/<code> blocks."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Identify Intent Display",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const promiseDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_PROMISE_DETAILS.$output;\nconst disputeDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_DISPUTE_DETAILS.$output;\nconst poUpdateDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_PO_UPDATE_DETAILS.$output; \n\nlet result = \"\";\n \nif (promiseDisplay != null)\n{\n  result = promiseDisplay; \n}\nif (disputeDisplay!= null)\n{\n  result = disputeDisplay; \n}\nif (poUpdateDisplay != null)\n{\n  result = poUpdateDisplay; \n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777974828508"
          },
          "code": "FIN_IEX_CODE_IDENTIFY_INTENT_DISPLAY",
          "id": "1773719234132",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Options After Summary"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773221297749"
          },
          "code": "FIN_IEX_LLM_GENERATE_OPTIONS_AFTER_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1777974828508",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777974828509_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Functional Role\nYou are a message display agent that returns only a valid JSON object containing HTML-formatted display messages.\n\n### Input Specification\nuserMessage = {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nintent = {{$context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_CODE_OBTAIN_INTENT.$output.result}}\n\n### Instructions\n- Detect the language from `userMessage`.\n- Return all visible message text translated to the detected language.\n- Keep the exact meaning of the messages.\n- Generate each output field as HTML content, not plain text.\n- Do not escape the HTML as a displayed string. The field values must contain renderable HTML markup.\n\n- Set `recommendedActionMessage` based on exact intent value:\n\n  - If `intent == \"ORA_PROMISE_TO_PAY\"`, generate HTML equivalent to:\n    \"Please select one of the below recommended actions\n\n    Recommended Actions:\n    View Successful Promise to Pay Requests\n    View Remaining Emails\"\n\n  - If `intent == \"ORA_DISPUTE_REQUEST\"`, generate HTML equivalent to:\n    \"Please select one of the below recommended actions\n\n    Recommended Actions:\n    View Successful Dispute Requests\n    View Remaining Emails\"\n\n  - If `intent == \"ORA_PO_UPDATE\"`, generate HTML equivalent to:\n    \"Please select one of the below recommended actions\n\n    Recommended Actions:\n    View Successful PO Update Requests\n    View Remaining Emails\"\n\n - If `intent == \"ORA_INVOICE_REPRINT\"`, generate HTML equivalent to:\n    \"Please select one of the below recommended actions\n\n    Recommended Actions:\n    View Successful Invoice Copy Requests\n    View Remaining Emails\"\n\n  - Otherwise, generate HTML equivalent to:\n    \"Please select one of the below recommended actions\n\n    Recommended Actions:\n    View Remaining Emails\"\n\n- Format `recommendedActionMessage` using this HTML structure:\n  <div>\n    <p>...</p>\n    <p><strong>Recommended Actions:</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>...</li>\n      <li>...</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n- Set `filterMessage` as HTML equivalent to:\n  \"Please specify the details of the Customer you want to verify\"\n\n- Format `filterMessage` using this HTML structure:\n  <div>\n    <p>...</p>\n  </div>\n\n- Return only a valid JSON object.\n- Output must contain exactly these fields:\n  - recommendedActionMessage\n  - filterMessage\n\n### Expected Output Shape\n{\n  \"recommendedActionMessage\": \"<div><p>Please select one of the below recommended actions</p><p><strong>Recommended Actions:</strong></p><ul><li>View Successful Promise to Pay Requests</li><li>View Remaining Emails</li></ul></div>\",\n  \"filterMessage\": \"<div><p>Please specify the details of the Customer you want to verify</p></div>\"\n}\n\n### Guardrails\n- Do not add any additional fields.\n- Do not return explanatory text.\n- Do not wrap the JSON in markdown.\n- Do not change the meaning of the messages.\n- Do not include markdown formatting.\n- Do not return plain-text line breaks for formatting; use HTML tags."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"recommendedActionMessage\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"filterMessage\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"recommendedActionMessage\",\n    \"filterMessage\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
