          "code": "FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_PROMISE_ACTION_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1772106255110",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772106255112_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Functional Role \nYou are an action summarizing agent that will display the summary of output response \n\nInput Specification\noutputArray : {{$context.$variables.OutputArray}} \ncounts : {{$context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_CODE_OBTAIN_SUCCESSFUL_AND_ERRORED_PROMISE_COUNTS.$output.result}} \n\nInstructions\n- You have two sections in the display, the first section should be the summary and the second section will be the errors details.\n\nWHAT TO DISPLAY \n\nSummary table (first section)\nTitle: Summary\n\nDisplay a 3-column HTML table.\n\nColumns:\nTotal Promise Requests\nSuccessfully created Promises\nErrored Promise Requests\n\nValues:\nTotal Promise Requests = counts.totalRecords\nSuccessfully created Promises = counts.processedCount\nErrored Promise Requests = counts.processingErrorCount\n\nDisplay the Error Details Table only if Errored Promise Requests is not equal to 0.\n\nErrors Details table (second section)\nTitle: Errors Details\n\nDisplay ONLY records that are errors (those where parsed output JSON contains status).\n\nDisplay a 5-column HTML table.\n\nColumns:\nCustomer\nTransaction Number\nPromise Date\nPromise Amount\nError Message\n\nFor errored records only:\n- Use `responseData.messageId` from each `outputArray` record\n- Do not use promise details, messageDetailId, or any external lookup for grouping\n- Error Message = `responseData.detail`\n- Group records by `responseData.messageId`\n- For each `messageId` group:\n  - groupRowCount = number of rows in that group\n  - render exactly groupRowCount `<tr>`\n  - first row only: render Customer cell with `rowspan"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Identify Summary Display",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let result = \"\";\ntry {\n  // Access display outputs safely with optional chaining\n  const promiseDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_PROMISE_ACTION_SUMMARY.$output;\n  const disputeDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_DISPUTE_ACTION_SUMMARY.$output; \nconst poUpdateDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_UPDATE_PO_ACTION_SUMMARY.$output;\n\n  // Assign result based on priority: promiseDisplay > disputeDisplay > poUpdateDisplay\n  if (promiseDisplay != null) {\n    result = typeof promiseDisplay === \"string\" ? promiseDisplay : JSON.stringify(promiseDisplay);\n  } else if (disputeDisplay != null) {\n    result = typeof disputeDisplay === \"string\" ? disputeDisplay : JSON.stringify(disputeDisplay);\n  } else if (poUpdateDisplay != null) {\n    result = typeof poUpdateDisplay === \"string\" ? poUpdateDisplay : JSON.stringify(poUpdateDisplay);\n  } else {\n    result = \"\";\n  }\n} catch (error) {\n  result = \"\";\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777962288413"
          },
