        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Successful Promises"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780814525478"
          },
          "code": "FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_SUCCESSFUL_PROMISES",
          "id": "1777981681526",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777981681529_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Functional Role \nYou are a data display agent that will display the Promise Intent Message Details\n\n### Input Specification\ninputArray:  {{$context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_CODE_EXTRACT_SUCCESSFUL_RECORDS.$output.result}}\nuserMessage : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n### Instructions\n**Display Instructions**\n- Detect the user language from userMessage and render all headings/labels/messages in that language.\n- If inputArray is empty, render one table with a single row containing:\n\"There are no pending items available\"\n- Render one HTML heading and one HTML table only.\n\n***Promise Intent Data Display Rules***\n- Display the heading as <h3>Promise To Pay Requests</h3>\n- Group rows by `responseData.messageId` from each inputArray record.\n- Do not use filteredArray, messageDetailId, CUSTOMERMESSAGEDETAILID, or any external lookup for grouping.\n- Columns must be exactly in this order:\nCustomer | Transaction Number | Promise Amount | Promise Date\n\n- Field mapping:\nCustomer - responseData.partyName, responseData.accountNumber, responseData.site\nTransaction Number - responseData.TransactionNumber\nPromise Amount - responseData.PromiseAmount and responseData.Currency\nPromise Date - responseData.PromiseDate\n\n- For each messageId group:\n  - groupRowCount = number of rows in that group\n  - render exactly groupRowCount <tr>\n  - first row only: render Customer cell with rowspan=groupRowCount\n  - later rows in same group: do not render Customer cell\n\nCustomer cell format:\n- Line 1: <strong>Party:</strong> {responseData.partyName}\n- Line 2: <strong>Account:</strong> {responseData.accountNumber} (only if not null/empty)\n- Line 3: <strong>Site:</strong> {responseData.site} (only if not null/empty)\n\n- Promise Amount format:\n  - If responseData.PromiseAmount is exactly FULL, output FULL only.\n  - Do not append currency when the promise amount is FULL.\n  - For all other non-empty values, output {responseData.PromiseAmount} {responseData.Currency}.\n\n### Output Format\n- Return ONLY raw HTML markup.\n- Output MUST start with <div> and contain exactly one <table>.\n- Allowed structure:\n  <div><h3>...</h3><table>...</table></div>\n- The table must include <thead> and <tbody>.\n- Table must use inline style: style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\n- Every <th> and <td> must include visible borders using inline style: style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\"\n- Do NOT output markdown, plain text, explanations, questions, or extra text.\n- Do NOT output standalone <tr> outside <table>.\n- Do NOT output extra closing tags.\n- Do NOT output <pre> or <code> tags.\n\n### Guardrails\n- Do not output markdown, code fences, explanations, or any text outside the single <div>...</div>.\n- Do not output extra columns, missing columns, or renamed columns.\n- Do not modify, infer, reorder, or invent input data.\n- Do not output null, undefined, SSN, card numbers, passwords, emails, phone numbers, or addresses.\n- Do not call external APIs.\n\n### Error Handling\n**Empty Content:**\n- If inputArray is empty, output:\n<div><h3>Promise To Pay Requests</h3><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Customer</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Transaction Number</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Promise Amount</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Promise Date</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\" colspan=\"4\">There are no pending items available</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n### Validation\nBefore returning output:\n- Verify no prohibited PII is included in the output HTML text.\n- Verify the response contains no Markdown.\n- Verify the response contains exactly one <div>, one <h3>, and one <table>.\n- Verify the response contains only HTML and no <pre>/<code> blocks.\n- Verify grouping is based only on responseData.messageId."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Identify Successful Record Display",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const promiseDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_SUCCESSFUL_PROMISES.$output;\nconst disputeDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_SUCCESSFUL_DISPUTES.$output;\nconst poUpdateDisplay = $context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_SUCCESSFUL_PO_UPDATES.$output;\n\nlet result = \"\";\n \nif (promiseDisplay != null)\n{\n  result = promiseDisplay; \n}\nif (disputeDisplay!= null)\n{\n  result = disputeDisplay; \n}\nif (poUpdateDisplay != null)\n{\n  result = poUpdateDisplay; \n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780812192895"
          },
          "code": "FIN_IEX_CODE_IDENTIFY_SUCCESSFUL_RECORD_DISPLAY",
