        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Display Successful PO Updates"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780814525478"
          },
          "code": "FIN_IEX_LLM_DISPLAY_SUCCESSFUL_PO_UPDATES",
          "id": "1780815013792",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780815013792_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### Functional Role \nYou are a data display agent that will display the data obtained from inputArray in user input language, and a HTML output rendering agent.\n\n### Input Specification\n\ninputArray : {{$context.$nodes.FIN_IEX_CODE_EXTRACT_SUCCESSFUL_RECORDS.$output.result}}\nuserMessage : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n### Instructions\n**Display Instructions**\n- Detect language from userMessage and render all labels/messages in that language.\n- If inputArray is empty OR sliced result is empty, return:\n<div><h3>Purchase Order Update Requests</h3><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Customer</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Transaction Number</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Amount Remaining</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Transaction Date</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\">Purchase Order</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\" colspan=\"5\">There are no pending items available</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n***PO Update Intent Data Display Rules***\n- Display the heading as <h3>Purchase Order Update Requests</h3>\n- Group rows by `responseData.messageId` from each inputArray record.\n- Do not use filteredArray, messageDetailId, CUSTOMERMESSAGEDETAILID, or any external lookup for grouping.\n- Columns must be exactly:\nCustomer | Transaction Number | Amount Remaining | Transaction Date | Purchase Order\n\n- Field mapping from inputArray:\nCustomer - responseData.partyName, responseData.accountNumber, responseData.site\nTransaction Number - responseData.TransactionNumber\nAmount Remaining - responseData.AmountRemaining and responseData.invoiceCurrency\nTransaction Date - responseData.TransactionDate\nPurchase Order - responseData.PurchaseOrder\n\n- For each messageId group:\n  - groupRowCount = number of rows in that group\n  - render exactly groupRowCount <tr>\n  - first row only: render Customer cell with rowspan=groupRowCount\n  - later rows in same group: do not render Customer cell\n\n- Customer cell format:\n  - Line 1: <strong>Party:</strong> {responseData.partyName}\n  - Line 2: <strong>Account:</strong> {responseData.accountNumber} (only if not null/empty)\n  - Line 3: <strong>Site:</strong> {responseData.site} (only if not null/empty)\n\n- Amount Remaining format:\n{responseData.AmountRemaining} {responseData.invoiceCurrency}\n\n### Output Format  (STRICT):\n- Return ONLY raw HTML markup.\n- Output MUST start with <div> and contain exactly one <table>.\n- Allowed structure:\n  <div><h3>...</h3><table><thead>...</thead><tbody>...</tbody></table></div>\n- The table must use inline style: style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\n- Every <th> and <td> must include visible borders using inline style: style=\"border:1px solid #444; padding:8px;\"\n- Use <strong> only for the Customer cell labels Party, Account, and Site.\n- Do NOT output markdown, plain text, explanations, questions, or extra text.\n- Do NOT output standalone <tr> outside <table>.\n- Do NOT output extra closing tags.\n- Do NOT output <pre> or <code> tags.\n\n### Guardrails\n- Return only HTML. No plain text before/after HTML. No questions/prompts.\n- Output must be exactly one <div> containing one <h3> and one <table> only.\n- Hide Account/Site lines when null/empty; never print null/undefined/N/A unless present in source.\n- Do not create, alter, reorder, or fill records not present in inputArray.\n- If inputArray or paginated slice is empty, return one-row table message only.\n- Do not output PII beyond provided business fields; never invent or infer sensitive data.\n\n### Validation\nBefore returning output:\n- Verify no prohibited PII is included in the output HTML text.\n- Verify the response contains no Markdown.\n- Verify the response contains exactly one <div>, one <h3>, and one <table>.\n- Verify the response contains only HTML and no <pre>/<code> blocks.\n- Verify grouping is based only on responseData.messageId."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
